{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0223_1000_p", "source_sha256": "993350f7a25094a217cdf6ced1a27caeac6f101609604c15e591fbd1f277a46b", "ja": "（亜利沙達3人のバンド公演は、大反響だった！\n早くも、リバイバル公演を望む声が届いている……）", "zh": "（亚利沙等3人的乐队演出，反响十分热烈！已经有观众希望能尽快举办复出演出了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0223_1001_028ari", "source_sha256": "8c4c7231ef3022b78eb44b3f19aaa498795678df114b09f426d007d5f6544dbd", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん。\nお疲れさまですっ！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生。\n辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0223_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a1ab00dc35f489622770747bf2aa80a7c26334eafef8ac003121a8b4490b6d0e", "ja": "亜利沙、ちょうどよかった。この間のライブの\n反響なんだけど、感想とかもう見たか？", "zh": "亜利沙，正好。关于前阵子演唱会的反响，你已经看过大家的感想之类的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0223_1003_028ari", "source_sha256": "6f0ecd50a478b3a9414e424ad7ea9c67ba4ed49d24509fad8e664f6964801984", "ja": "もちろんチェック済みですっ！　アイドルちゃんの\nまとめサイトでも、かなり話題になってましたから♪", "zh": "当然早就看过了！偶像汇总站上也引起了相当大的反响呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0223_1004_p", "source_sha256": "4e205f0f0f5da02f76469fa0a029b40ecf75c887f55908271a8ccc84c90533ac", "ja": "そうか、だったら話が早いな。リバイバル公演を\n望む声が多いし、検討してみようと思うんだけど……。", "zh": "这样啊，那就好办了。希望重演公演的呼声很高，所以我想考虑一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0223_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "9e449c83aeb50d9f8317c0e87aa05d3fa2214267c30a99814b619236094f9a33", "ja": "ほ、本当ですかっ！？　ハイハイッ、賛成です！\nありさ、またバンドでステージに立ちたいですっ！", "zh": "真、真的吗！？好好，我赞成！  \n亚利沙还想再次和乐队一起站上舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0223_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "e05e01e87b6204b90586724a9e013d2af5fa475645d254a463781db81b965cfd", "ja": "あの伝説のライブを再び……！　ムフフ♪\nいちアイドルちゃんファンとしても、燃える展開です！", "zh": "再次重现那场传说的演唱会……！嘿嘿嘿♪\n作为一名小偶像粉丝，这发展也太让人燃起来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0223_1007_p", "source_sha256": "37178ab9a212b7595e5dbefd155ac1646e28bf9877dd8d800fcccaea1be90df0", "ja": "そうだな。あ、せっかくだし、今度こそ\nアレに挑戦してみてもいいかもしれないな。", "zh": "是啊。啊，难得有这个机会，这次或许真的可以挑战一下那个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0223_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "fd1a8fd26e8ef2269165b1701f5c9f5805c554821c90cad6798d51bb83ef2e36", "ja": "ギクッ！？\nあ、アレ……といいますと……？", "zh": "吓！？\n啊，您说的那个……是指……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0223_1009_p", "source_sha256": "ec961a11f703a0aa59faf5d707b1f0aa5c33beef0d2299046aeaeb0da600a8b4", "ja": "亜利沙、最初はボイパの練習をしてただろ？\nリバイバル公演なら、練習時間も取れるし……。", "zh": "亚利沙，你一开始不是在练习人声打击吗？\n如果是重演公演的话，也能抽出时间练习……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0223_1010_028ari", "source_sha256": "ee754a8ebf4d3ab59d674536167bd2469044684e34c0ae9a2bae3d45ce801bd3", "ja": "やぁ～んっ！！　それはダメですっ！\nありさ、ボイパだけはできません～っ！！！", "zh": "呀——！！　那个不行的啦！\n亚利沙唯独口技绝对做不来啦～！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0223_1011_p", "source_sha256": "a012f25fa9f4f13edabc4c641e611c771a7ab37d171260a04b3ce527eaed6aaf", "ja": "そ、そんなにか？　難しいのはわかるけど、\n何事もチャレンジしてみないと……。", "zh": "有、这么夸张吗？我知道很难，可是不管什么事，都得试着挑战一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0223_1012_028ari", "source_sha256": "66d2b53264103d2422180de0b39d8e6786e42e5784f40e679abbb51af220919a", "ja": "いえ、難しいというか、その……\nは、恥ずかしくて……！", "zh": "不、与其说是难，不如说那个……\n太、太不好意思了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0223_1013_p", "source_sha256": "f6c2adbe4f220c7d4b1fdbc565c43a991325a9fdeac9a8337f5e4adadd6a00f1", "ja": "恥ずかしい？", "zh": "觉得不好意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0223_1014_028ari", "source_sha256": "fbd48394e761157bb7df10d85b99de1a9e89bb65a4383549133c46a6326f3c2b", "ja": "はい……。ありさ、家で練習してる時に、\nボイパしてるところを動画に録ってみたんです。", "zh": "是的……亚利沙在家练习的时候，\n试着把自己进行人声打击乐的样子录成了视频。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0223_1015_028ari", "source_sha256": "c847709bdc6840e44941313b2cefe837e7f2fdb8507362017128169c6a87e8b2", "ja": "そしたら、なんだか顔が……こう、\nアイドルちゃんとして、あるまじき感がして！", "zh": "结果不知怎么的，脸……就是那种，感觉作为偶像实在不应该露出这样的表情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0223_1016_p", "source_sha256": "f1951f4fd1f91a341eeb34bcc05d1d22a4c3b3c7c2ce82f74a269cff3e860ed0", "ja": "そ、そうか……。亜利沙が見せられないと\n判断したなら、仕方ない。無理強いはしないよ。", "zh": "这、这样啊……既然亚利沙判断不能给我看，那也没办法。我不会强人所难的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0223_1017_p", "source_sha256": "ee3bb3190a4f00220576ae9248ae10d3bfb9fa0f8c3da623ecc2dd0466c0915c", "ja": "でも、リバイバル公演はやってくれるだろう？", "zh": "不过，复刻公演还是会办的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0223_1018_028ari", "source_sha256": "2447aadf9651b1c8c4c042e03f0a71a72c57d89c2187d031076ccd383f4a6046", "ja": "はいっ、もちろんですっ！\nありさと恵美ちゃんと可奈ちゃん、3人で……。", "zh": "好的，当然可以！\n有纱、惠美、小可奈，我们3个人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0223_1019_028ari", "source_sha256": "d50b273acb3f8010bbbba0b3befbf74fc5757c32ae92de22fee163e0222aed08", "ja": "リバイバル公演でも、\n最高のビートを響かせてみせますよー！", "zh": "即使是复刻公演，也要让最棒的节拍响彻全场哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
